dia/attractions-splice-spp-360x240/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":320,"width":480,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-480x320/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":360,"width":540,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-540x360/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":446,"width":674,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-674x446/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":480,"width":720,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-720x480/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":118,"width":210,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-210x118/15/90/a5/88.jpg"},{"height":75,"width":75,"url":"https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-75x75/15/90/a5/88.jpg"}]}],"logistics":{"start":[{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5H17r2EhG2UfXruda/uyLW7l9+oAhP47INc6tMpCDORB"},"description":"You have to use public parking spots. These municipality-owned parking spots ARE NOT FREE (parking in Switzerland is not for free). Search for parking \"Interlaken Strandbadstrasse\" or \"Interlaken Casino\" to find parking spots nearby. Other parking spots are limited to 5 hours, but you need 7 hours."}],"end":[{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5H17r2EhG2UfXruda/uyLW7l9+oAhP47INc6tMpCDORB"},"description":"You have to use public parking spots. These municipality-owned parking spots ARE NOT FREE (parking in Switzerland is not for free). Search for parking \"Interlaken Strandbadstrasse\" or \"Interlaken Casino\" to find parking spots nearby. Other parking spots are limited to 5 hours, but you need 7 hours."}],"redemption":{"redemptionType":"NONE","specialInstructions":"\u2022 Meeting time is fifteen minutes before the departure time"},"travelerPickup":{"pickupOptionType":"MEET_EVERYONE_AT_START_POINT","allowCustomTravelerPickup":false}},"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich","description":"The Lauterbrunnen E-Bike Tour with Flying Wheels is a true highlight for nature lovers and leisure travelers. The tour takes you through one of the most breathtaking alpine valleys in Switzerland \u2013 the Lauterbrunnen Valley, often referred to as the \"Valley of 72 Waterfalls.\" The very first glimpse of the narrow valley, framed by steep cliffs with dramatic cascading waterfalls, lush green meadows, and traditional chalets, is simply stunning.\n\nWith Flying Wheels\u2019 high-quality e-bikes, you glide effortlessly and eco-friendly through the alpine landscape, passing roaring waterfalls like the Staubbach Falls and the Tr\u00fcmmelbach Falls \u2013 the latter a hidden natural wonder inside the mountain. And not to be forgotten: our famous Swiss Mountain Picnic! Everything is included in the price.\n\nExperienced guides from Flying Wheels enrich the tour with fascinating stories and ensure that every participant enjoys a safe and joyful ride. This tour is very unique and an exceptional experience. Promised!","inclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Bottled water. Bottle can be re-filled with glacier water on this tour."},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Professional guide"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Entry fee to the Trummelbach waterfalls (inside a mountain)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Swiss Mountain Picnic at a picturesque spot in the middle of the Waterfalls Valley"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Helmet"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Use of E-Bike. Try them and you\u00b4ll love them. Promised! (min. age 16, max weight 110 kgs/240 lbs)"}],"exclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Hotel pickup and drop-off (Flying Wheels is located in the center of Interlaken)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"no private parking available. Please use public parking places, if you come by car"}],"additionalInfo":[{"type":"PUBLIC_TRANSPORTATION_NEARBY","description":"Public transportation options are available nearby"},{"type":"NO_BACK_PROBLEMS","description":"Not recommended for travelers with spinal injuries"},{"type":"NO_HEART_PROBLEMS","description":"Not recommended for travelers with poor cardiovascular health"},{"type":"PHYSICAL_MEDIUM","description":"Travelers should have at least a moderate level of physical fitness"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"This is an intermediate level tour and thus NOT appropriate for persons, who are not confident riding a bicycle! For safety reasons we perform a bike riding test before the tour begins. If you sign in but the test reveals that you (or a person you have signed in) is only at beginner bike skill level, we'll have to exclude you (or any person you have signed in) from the tour. In these cases there will be NO REFUND. Thank you for your understanding."},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Teens must be at least 16 years to join this tour, and be accompanied by an adult who signs the legal disclaimer"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"This tour is NOT appropriate for kids/teens below 16 years. Child trailers or child seats are not possible"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Operates in case of light rain, please dress appropriately (rain coats and trousers, gloves etc. are provided by us for free). In case of heavy rain the tour is cancelled free of charge. Please don't rely too much on forecasts, speak to us before making wrong conclusions how the weather will be on the day of the tour. We are in the mountains and weather forecasts are not always correct."},{"type":"OTHER","description":"There's a weight limit for bicycles and e-bikes of 110 kgs / 240 lbs. For insurance and business liability reasons we are not allowed to hand-out the e-bike if you are above that limit."}],"cancellationPolicy":{"type":"STANDARD","description":"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours before the scheduled departure time.","cancelIfBadWeather":true,"cancelIfInsufficientTravelers":true,"refundEligibility":[{"dayRangeMin":1,"percentageRefundable":100},{"dayRangeMin":0,"dayRangeMax":1,"percentageRefundable":0}]},"bookingConfirmationSettings":{"bookingCutoffType":"START_TIME","bookingCutoffInMinutes":1080,"confirmationType":"MANUAL"},"bookingRequirements":{"minTravelersPerBooking":1,"maxTravelersPerBooking":4,"requiresAdultForBooking":true},"languageGuides":[{"type":"GUIDE","language":"en","legacyGuide":"en/SERVICE_GUIDE"}],"bookingQuestions":["AGEBAND","FULL_NAMES_FIRST","FULL_NAMES_LAST","HEIGHT","SPECIAL_REQUIREMENTS"],"tags":[21713,11938,11911,367654,21860,21972,11889,11929,367652,12075,367653,367661],"destinations":[{"ref":"5011","primary":true}],"itinerary":{"itineraryType":"STANDARD","skipTheLine":false,"privateTour":false,"maxTravelersInSharedTour":12,"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":360},"itineraryItems":[{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyEwEOuxByi2kJXsZ4PpZz0s="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":15},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"We start in the center of Interlaken at H\u00f6heweg 133, at the Flying Wheels bike shop (return point is as well here)"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyNMrewuz0KfQOgmUw1RHu24="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":10},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"A church from 12th century, a ancient wooden bridge having withstood floodings since centuries, and some old wooden chalets dating bach to 16th century: this stop is a true gem on our way to Lauterbrunnen"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMPI/WFhBknADTNgIG9VLGI="}},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"The guided e-bike tour takes you to Lauterbrunnen and into the amazing Valley of 72 Waterfalls"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyD1BbTeXZGtCuDgQtjn9l0E="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":15},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Lauterbrunnen's landmark and Switzerland's highest freefalling waterfall is a stop that will leave it's impression on you!"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMPI/WFhBknADTNgIG9VLGI="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":45},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Our famous Swiss picnic is one of the highlights of our e-bike tour! Unlike other tour operators, who give you either no or only cheap picnic options, we treat you with high-quality local food like homemade sausage, genuine alp cheese, fresh bread from a local bakery etc. Of course vegeterian or vegan options are available on request. \nWe'll serve this picnic in a wonderful spot in the middle of the Lauterbrunnen Valley, with views you won't believe. Don't miss this delicious picnic!"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyF+pXVh/VJofwQjnm8DWvHk="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":45},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"In Lauterbrunnen we will visit the mighty Truemmelbach Waterfalls inside the mountain, where up to 20,000 litres of water per second are thundering through the narrow gorge."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMRudyuWfc01wkZyU5CpDY0="},"attractionId":8800},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":10},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLI